title: HL-RCS — Registration Contact Verification
---
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor U as Guest
participant UI as «user interaction» AuthPage
participant C as «control» AuthController
participant S as «service» RegistrationOtpService
participant R as «entity» User / RegistrationOtp Repositories
participant D as «external adapter» RegistrationOtpSender
U->>UI: Enter email or phone; request OTP
UI->>+C: POST /api/auth/register/otp/send
C->>+S: send(identifier)
S->>+R: Check contact availability; findLocked(contact key)
R-->>-S: Existing account / challenge
alt Contact used or resend within 60 seconds
S-->>C: AppException (409 / 429)
C-->>UI: Error response (via exception handler)
UI-->>U: Display error
else Contact available and resend allowed
S->>S: Generate 6-digit code; hash; expire in 5 minutes
S->>+R: saveAndFlush(challenge)
R-->>-S: Saved challenge
S->>+D: send(contact, code)
Note right of D: Email via JavaMailSender<br/>Phone via Zalo template API
D-->>-S: Delivery request accepted or exception
alt Delivery unavailable or failed
S-->>C: AppException (503 / 502); rollback
C-->>UI: Error response
UI-->>U: Display delivery error
else Delivery request accepted
S-->>C: Sent(resendAfterSeconds=60, expiresInSeconds=300)
C-->>UI: HTTP 200 — ApiResponse
UI-->>U: Show OTP entry and resend countdown
end
end
deactivate S
deactivate C
U->>UI: Enter received OTP
UI->>+C: POST /api/auth/register/otp/verify
C->>+S: verify(identifier, code)
S->>+R: findLocked(contact key)
R-->>-S: Challenge or null
alt Missing, expired, used or incorrect code
S->>S: For wrong code, increment attempts; invalidate at 5
Note over S,R: Failed-attempt changes persist despite validation error
S-->>C: FieldValidationException
C-->>UI: HTTP 400 — code error
UI-->>U: Display error; retry or request new OTP
else Correct live OTP
S->>S: Generate verification token; hash token;<br/>mark verified; expire in 10 minutes
Note over S,R: JPA dirty checking persists challenge at commit
S-->>C: Verification(token, expiresInSeconds=600)
C-->>UI: HTTP 200 — ApiResponse
UI-->>U: Allow account registration
end
deactivate S
deactivate C
